-- Excerpt
'{
  "en": "Johannes Thingnes Bø has dominated men''s biathlon like few before him. The Norwegian combines exceptional skiing speed with accurate shooting to win races consistently.",
  "de": "Johannes Thingnes Bø hat den Männer-Biathlon dominiert wie wenige vor ihm. Der Norweger kombiniert außergewöhnliche Skigeschwindigkeit mit präzisem Schießen.",
  "fr": "Johannes Thingnes Bø a dominé le biathlon masculin comme peu avant lui. Le Norvégien combine vitesse de ski exceptionnelle et tir précis.",
  "it": "Johannes Thingnes Bø ha dominato il biathlon maschile come pochi prima di lui. Il norvegese combina velocità sugli sci eccezionale con tiro preciso.",
  "es": "Johannes Thingnes Bø ha dominado el biatlón masculino como pocos antes que él. El noruego combina velocidad excepcional en esquí con tiro preciso.",
  "pt": "Johannes Thingnes Bø dominou o biatlo masculino como poucos antes dele. O norueguês combina velocidade excepcional de esqui com tiro preciso.",
  "nl": "Johannes Thingnes Bø heeft het mannenbiathlon gedomineerd als weinigen voor hem. De Noor combineert uitzonderlijke skisnelheid met nauwkeurig schieten.",
  "ar": "يوهانس ثينغنس بو هيمن على البياثلون للرجال كقلة قبله. النرويجي يجمع بين سرعة تزلج استثنائية ورماية دقيقة.",
  "ja": "ヨハネス・ティンネス・ボーは、これまでほとんど例を見ないほど男子バイアスロンを支配してきました。このノルウェー人は卓越したスキースピードと正確な射撃を組み合わせています。",
  "zh": "约翰内斯·廷内斯·博以前所未有的方式主导了男子冬季两项。这位挪威人将卓越的滑雪速度与精准的射击相结合。",
  "ko": "요하네스 팅네스 뵈는 이전에 거의 없었던 방식으로 남자 바이애슬론을 지배해 왔습니다. 이 노르웨이인은 뛰어난 스키 속도와 정확한 사격을 결합합니다."
}'::jsonb,

-- Content
'{
  "en": "<article><h2>Career Overview</h2><p>Johannes Thingnes Bø has established himself as the most dominant biathlete of his generation. Born May 16, 1993, in Stryn, Norway, he has won multiple World Cup overall titles and numerous World Championship gold medals. His combination of skiing speed and shooting accuracy is unmatched.</p><h2>What Makes Bø Special</h2><p><a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">Biathlon</a> demands two contrasting skills: endurance skiing and precision shooting. Bø excels at both. His skiing speed is among the fastest in the field, often making up time even after missed shots. His shooting, particularly standing, has improved dramatically throughout his career.</p><h3>Skiing Ability</h3><p>Bø''s skiing technique combines efficiency with raw power. On the uphills, he maintains tempo that few can match. On flats and downhills, his technique allows him to recover for the shooting range. His ability to ski fast after shooting separates him from competitors.</p><h3>Shooting Performance</h3><p>While not always perfect, Bø''s shooting is highly consistent. He performs well under pressure and rarely has catastrophic shooting stages. His prone shooting is particularly strong. Standing shooting has evolved from a weakness to a strength.</p><h2>Racing Style</h2><p>Bø is known for aggressive tactics. He often pushes from the start, building gaps that give him margin for shooting errors. This high-risk approach works because his skiing speed can compensate for penalty loops. When he shoots clean, he is nearly unbeatable.</p><h2>Family Legacy</h2><p>Johannes competes alongside his older brother <a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">Tarjei Bø</a>, also a top biathlete. The brothers have won relay events together for Norway. Their family has become synonymous with Norwegian biathlon excellence.</p><h2>Key Venues</h2><p>Bø has triumphed at <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> before passionate home crowds. He has also excelled at venues like <a href=\"/antholz-venue-guide/\">Antholz</a> and <a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a>. World Championships have brought him gold in various event formats.</p><h2>Competition</h2><p>Bø faces competition from French athletes like <a href=\"/quentin-fillon-maillet-profile/\">Quentin Fillon Maillet</a> and <a href=\"/emilien-jacquelin-profile/\">Emilien Jacquelin</a>, as well as teammate <a href=\"/sturla-holm-laegreid-profile/\">Sturla Holm Lægreid</a>. These rivalries have produced exciting racing.</p><h2>Training and Preparation</h2><p>Norwegian biathlon training emphasizes both skiing volume and shooting precision. Bø trains at altitude and uses modern technology to analyze performance. His preparation is meticulous, leaving nothing to chance.</p><h2>Impact on Biathlon</h2><p>Bø has raised the profile of biathlon in Norway and worldwide. His dominance and charismatic personality have attracted new fans to the sport. He represents the evolution of biathlon toward faster, more athletic competition.</p></article>",

  "de": "<article><h2>Karriereübersicht</h2><p>Johannes Thingnes Bø hat sich als der dominanteste Biathlet seiner Generation etabliert. Am 16. Mai 1993 in Stryn, Norwegen, geboren, hat er mehrere Gesamtweltcup-Titel und zahlreiche WM-Goldmedaillen gewonnen. Seine Kombination aus Skigeschwindigkeit und Schießgenauigkeit ist unerreicht.</p><h2>Was Bø besonders macht</h2><p><a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">Biathlon</a> verlangt zwei gegensätzliche Fähigkeiten: Ausdauerskilaufen und Präzisionsschießen. Bø glänzt in beiden. Seine Skigeschwindigkeit gehört zu den schnellsten im Feld.</p><h3>Skilauf-Fähigkeit</h3><p>Bøs Skitechnik kombiniert Effizienz mit roher Kraft. Bergauf hält er ein Tempo, das wenige erreichen können.</p><h3>Schießleistung</h3><p>Obwohl nicht immer perfekt, ist Bøs Schießen sehr konstant. Er leistet unter Druck gut.</p><h2>Rennstil</h2><p>Bø ist für aggressive Taktiken bekannt. Er pusht oft vom Start weg und baut Vorsprünge auf.</p><h2>Familienvermächtnis</h2><p>Johannes tritt neben seinem älteren Bruder <a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">Tarjei Bø</a> an, ebenfalls ein Top-Biathlet.</p><h2>Wichtige Austragungsorte</h2><p>Bø hat am <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> vor begeistertem Heimpublikum triumphiert. Er hat auch in <a href=\"/antholz-venue-guide/\">Antholz</a> und <a href=\"/ruhpolding-venue-guide/\">Ruhpolding</a> brilliert.</p><h2>Konkurrenz</h2><p>Bø steht in Konkurrenz zu französischen Athleten wie <a href=\"/quentin-fillon-maillet-profile/\">Quentin Fillon Maillet</a> und Teamkollege <a href=\"/sturla-holm-laegreid-profile/\">Sturla Holm Lægreid</a>.</p></article>",

  "fr": "<article><h2>Aperçu de carrière</h2><p>Johannes Thingnes Bø s''est imposé comme le biathlète le plus dominant de sa génération. Né le 16 mai 1993 à Stryn, Norvège, il a remporté plusieurs titres au général de la Coupe du monde et de nombreuses médailles d''or aux Championnats du monde.</p><h2>Ce qui rend Bø spécial</h2><p>Le <a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">biathlon</a> exige deux compétences contrastées: le ski d''endurance et le tir de précision. Bø excelle dans les deux.</p><h3>Capacité de ski</h3><p>La technique de ski de Bø combine efficacité et puissance brute. En montée, il maintient un tempo que peu peuvent égaler.</p><h3>Performance au tir</h3><p>Bien que pas toujours parfait, le tir de Bø est très constant.</p><h2>Style de course</h2><p>Bø est connu pour ses tactiques agressives. Il pousse souvent dès le départ.</p><h2>Héritage familial</h2><p>Johannes court aux côtés de son frère aîné <a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">Tarjei Bø</a>, également un top biathlète.</p><h2>Sites clés</h2><p>Bø a triomphé à <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> devant un public passionné.</p><h2>Compétition</h2><p>Bø affronte des athlètes français comme <a href=\"/quentin-fillon-maillet-profile/\">Quentin Fillon Maillet</a> et son coéquipier <a href=\"/sturla-holm-laegreid-profile/\">Sturla Holm Lægreid</a>.</p></article>",

  "it": "<article><h2>Panoramica della carriera</h2><p>Johannes Thingnes Bø si è affermato come il biatleta più dominante della sua generazione. Nato il 16 maggio 1993 a Stryn, Norvegia, ha vinto più titoli generali di Coppa del Mondo e numerose medaglie d''oro ai Mondiali.</p><h2>Cosa rende Bø speciale</h2><p>Il <a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">biathlon</a> richiede due abilità contrastanti: sci di resistenza e tiro di precisione. Bø eccelle in entrambe.</p><h3>Capacità sugli sci</h3><p>La tecnica di sci di Bø combina efficienza con potenza grezza.</p><h3>Prestazioni di tiro</h3><p>Sebbene non sempre perfetto, il tiro di Bø è molto costante.</p><h2>Stile di gara</h2><p>Bø è noto per tattiche aggressive. Spinge spesso dalla partenza.</p><h2>Eredità familiare</h2><p>Johannes gareggia accanto al fratello maggiore <a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">Tarjei Bø</a>.</p><h2>Sedi chiave</h2><p>Bø ha trionfato a <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> davanti a un pubblico appassionato.</p><h2>Competizione</h2><p>Bø affronta atleti francesi come <a href=\"/quentin-fillon-maillet-profile/\">Quentin Fillon Maillet</a> e il compagno di squadra <a href=\"/sturla-holm-laegreid-profile/\">Sturla Holm Lægreid</a>.</p></article>",

  "es": "<article><h2>Resumen de carrera</h2><p>Johannes Thingnes Bø se ha establecido como el biatleta más dominante de su generación. Nacido el 16 de mayo de 1993 en Stryn, Noruega, ha ganado múltiples títulos generales de la Copa del Mundo.</p><h2>Qué hace especial a Bø</h2><p>El <a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">biatlón</a> exige dos habilidades contrastantes: esquí de resistencia y tiro de precisión. Bø sobresale en ambas.</p><h3>Capacidad de esquí</h3><p>La técnica de esquí de Bø combina eficiencia con potencia bruta.</p><h3>Rendimiento de tiro</h3><p>Aunque no siempre perfecto, el tiro de Bø es muy constante.</p><h2>Estilo de carrera</h2><p>Bø es conocido por tácticas agresivas.</p><h2>Legado familiar</h2><p>Johannes compite junto a su hermano mayor <a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">Tarjei Bø</a>.</p><h2>Sedes clave</h2><p>Bø ha triunfado en <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> ante su público.</p><h2>Competencia</h2><p>Bø enfrenta competencia de atletas franceses como <a href=\"/quentin-fillon-maillet-profile/\">Quentin Fillon Maillet</a>.</p></article>",

  "pt": "<article><h2>Visão geral da carreira</h2><p>Johannes Thingnes Bø se estabeleceu como o biatleta mais dominante de sua geração. Nascido em 16 de maio de 1993 em Stryn, Noruega, ele ganhou múltiplos títulos gerais da Copa do Mundo.</p><h2>O que torna Bø especial</h2><p>O <a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">biatlo</a> exige duas habilidades contrastantes: esqui de resistência e tiro de precisão. Bø se destaca em ambas.</p><h3>Capacidade de esqui</h3><p>A técnica de esqui de Bø combina eficiência com força bruta.</p><h3>Desempenho de tiro</h3><p>Embora nem sempre perfeito, o tiro de Bø é muito consistente.</p><h2>Estilo de corrida</h2><p>Bø é conhecido por táticas agressivas.</p><h2>Legado familiar</h2><p>Johannes compete ao lado de seu irmão mais velho <a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">Tarjei Bø</a>.</p><h2>Locais principais</h2><p>Bø triunfou em <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a> diante de seu público.</p><h2>Competição</h2><p>Bø enfrenta competição de atletas franceses como <a href=\"/quentin-fillon-maillet-profile/\">Quentin Fillon Maillet</a>.</p></article>",

  "nl": "<article><h2>Carrière overzicht</h2><p>Johannes Thingnes Bø heeft zich gevestigd als de meest dominante biatleet van zijn generatie. Geboren op 16 mei 1993 in Stryn, Noorwegen, heeft hij meerdere Wereldbeker algemene titels gewonnen.</p><h2>Wat Bø bijzonder maakt</h2><p><a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">Biathlon</a> vereist twee contrasterende vaardigheden: duurskiën en precisieschieten. Bø blinkt uit in beide.</p><h3>Skivaardigheid</h3><p>Bøs skitechniek combineert efficiëntie met ruwe kracht.</p><h3>Schietprestaties</h3><p>Hoewel niet altijd perfect, is Bøs schieten zeer consistent.</p><h2>Racestijl</h2><p>Bø staat bekend om agressieve tactieken.</p><h2>Familie erfenis</h2><p>Johannes concurreert naast zijn oudere broer <a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">Tarjei Bø</a>.</p><h2>Belangrijke locaties</h2><p>Bø heeft gezegevierd op <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">Holmenkollen</a>.</p><h2>Competitie</h2><p>Bø staat tegenover Franse atleten zoals <a href=\"/quentin-fillon-maillet-profile/\">Quentin Fillon Maillet</a>.</p></article>",

  "ar": "<article><h2>نظرة عامة على المسيرة</h2><p>أثبت يوهانس ثينغنس بو نفسه كأكثر رياضي بياثلون هيمنة في جيله. ولد في 16 مايو 1993 في سترين، النرويج، وفاز بعدة ألقاب عامة في كأس العالم.</p><h2>ما يجعل بو مميزًا</h2><p>يتطلب <a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">البياثلون</a> مهارتين متناقضتين: التزلج للتحمل والرماية الدقيقة. بو يتفوق في كليهما.</p><h3>قدرة التزلج</h3><p>تقنية التزلج لدى بو تجمع بين الكفاءة والقوة الخام.</p><h3>أداء الرماية</h3><p>رغم أنه ليس دائمًا مثاليًا، فإن رماية بو ثابتة جدًا.</p><h2>أسلوب السباق</h2><p>بو معروف بتكتيكاته العدوانية.</p><h2>إرث العائلة</h2><p>يوهانس يتنافس إلى جانب شقيقه الأكبر <a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">تاريي بو</a>.</p><h2>الأماكن الرئيسية</h2><p>انتصر بو في <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">هولمنكولن</a>.</p></article>",

  "ja": "<article><h2>キャリア概要</h2><p>ヨハネス・ティンネス・ボーは、同世代で最も支配的なバイアスロン選手として確立しました。1993年5月16日、ノルウェーのストリン生まれで、複数のワールドカップ総合タイトルを獲得しています。</p><h2>ボーが特別な理由</h2><p><a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">バイアスロン</a>は2つの対照的なスキル、持久力スキーと精密射撃を要求します。ボーは両方で優れています。</p><h3>スキー能力</h3><p>ボーのスキー技術は効率性と生の力を組み合わせています。</p><h3>射撃パフォーマンス</h3><p>常に完璧ではありませんが、ボーの射撃は非常に安定しています。</p><h2>レーススタイル</h2><p>ボーは攻撃的な戦術で知られています。</p><h2>家族の遺産</h2><p>ヨハネスは兄の<a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">タルイェイ・ボー</a>と一緒に競技しています。</p><h2>主要な会場</h2><p>ボーは<a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">ホルメンコーレン</a>で勝利を収めています。</p></article>",

  "zh": "<article><h2>职业生涯概述</h2><p>约翰内斯·廷内斯·博已确立自己为同代最具统治力的冬季两项运动员。1993年5月16日出生于挪威斯特林，他赢得了多个世界杯总冠军。</p><h2>博的特别之处</h2><p><a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">冬季两项</a>需要两种截然相反的技能：耐力滑雪和精准射击。博在两方面都很出色。</p><h3>滑雪能力</h3><p>博的滑雪技术结合了效率和原始力量。</p><h3>射击表现</h3><p>虽然并非总是完美，但博的射击非常稳定。</p><h2>比赛风格</h2><p>博以激进的战术著称。</p><h2>家族传承</h2><p>约翰内斯与哥哥<a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">塔尔耶·博</a>一起比赛。</p><h2>主要场馆</h2><p>博在<a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">霍尔门科伦</a>取得了胜利。</p></article>",

  "ko": "<article><h2>경력 개요</h2><p>요하네스 팅네스 뵈는 자신의 세대에서 가장 지배적인 바이애슬론 선수로 자리매김했습니다. 1993년 5월 16일 노르웨이 스트린에서 태어나 여러 월드컵 종합 타이틀을 획득했습니다.</p><h2>뵈가 특별한 이유</h2><p><a href=\"/biathlon-explained/\">바이애슬론</a>은 두 가지 대조적인 기술을 요구합니다: 지구력 스키와 정밀 사격. 뵈는 둘 다 뛰어납니다.</p><h3>스키 능력</h3><p>뵈의 스키 기술은 효율성과 생 파워를 결합합니다.</p><h3>사격 성과</h3><p>항상 완벽하지는 않지만 뵈의 사격은 매우 일관적입니다.</p><h2>레이싱 스타일</h2><p>뵈는 공격적인 전술로 유명합니다.</p><h2>가족 유산</h2><p>요하네스는 형 <a href=\"/tarjei-boe-profile/\">타르예이 뵈</a>와 함께 경쟁합니다.</p><h2>주요 경기장</h2><p>뵈는 <a href=\"/holmenkollen-venue-guide/\">홀멘콜렌</a>에서 승리했습니다.</p></article>"
}'::jsonb,

